s, Ketones and Carboxylic Acids Question 204 English Explanation\">\n<br><br>(a) B will be more crystalline due to more inter molecular interactions hence more efficient packing.\n<br><br>(b) B will have higher boiling point due to higher intermolecular interactions.\n<br><br>(c) B will be more soluble in water than A as B will have more extent of H-bonding in water.\n"},"hi":{"content":"निम्नलिखित अणुओं और\nउनसे संबंधित कथनों पर विचार करें :\n<img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/jgy2xukf3m3f19/6f941cf5-b8ce-4686-affd-b688dfebba86/d4d4f8d0-f721-11ea-8293-3b6cc591631c/file-jgy2xukf3m3f1a-260w.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 3rd September Evening Slot Chemistry - Aldehydes, Ketones and Carboxylic Acids Question 204 Hindi\">\n<br>(a) (B) की तुलना में (A) क्रिस्टलीय होने की संभावना अधिक है\n<br>(b) (B) का क्वथनांक (A) से अधिक है\n<br>(c) (B) पानी में (A) की तुलना में अधिक सहजता से घुलता है\n<br><br>नीचे दिए गए विकल्पों में से सही विकल्प की पहचान करें :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"केवल (a) सत्य है"},{"identifier":"B","content":"(a), (b) और (c) सत्य हैं"},{"identifier":"C","content":"(b) और (c) सत्य हैं"},{"identifier":"D","content":"(a) और (b) सत्य हैं"}],"correct_options":["B"],"answer":null,"explanation":null,"comprehension":null,"direction":null}},"question_id":"1tjsmRFrVbgRxq6Y4vjgy2xukf3moxsa","updated_time":1605331608,"permalink":"consider-the-following-molecules-and-statements-related-to-t-jee-main-chemistry-chemical-bonding-and-molecular-structure-ptagrwyoknruzcdy","paperId":"jee-main-2020-online-3rd-september-evening-slot","topic":"preparation-properties-and-uses-of-carboxylic-acids","isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["multi_statements"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2020-online-3rd-september-evening-slot","active":true},{"country":"in","examGroup":"jee","exam":"jee-main","subjectGroup":null,"subject":"chemistry","chapterGroup":"inorganic-chemistry","c